{"id":"p1m7","name":"Words with their position","lang":"pyspark","entry":"solve","params":["spark","lines_df"],"limit_s":30,"ordered":true,"desc":"<p><code>lines_df</code> has the columns <code>line_id</code> (integer) and <code>text</code> (string). Words in <code>text</code> are separated by exactly one space.</p>\n<p>Return one row per word with <code>line_id</code>, <code>pos</code> (the position of the word in its line, starting at <code>1</code>) and <code>word</code>, sorted by <code>line_id</code>, then <code>pos</code>.</p>\n<h4>Example</h4><p><code>lines_df</code>:</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>line_id</th><th>text</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>big data is fun</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>spark</td></tr></table></div><p>the output should be</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>line_id</th><th>pos</th><th>word</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>1</td><td>big</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>2</td><td>data</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>3</td><td>is</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>4</td><td>fun</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>1</td><td>spark</td></tr></table></div><div class=\"lim\"><b>[execution time limit]</b> 30 seconds (pyspark)<br><b>[memory limit]</b> 2 GB</div>","starter":"from pyspark.sql import SparkSession, DataFrame, functions as F\n\n\ndef solve(spark: SparkSession, lines_df: DataFrame) -> DataFrame:\n    # write your code here\n    return lines_df\n","hints":["F.split(\"text\", \" \") donne un tableau. F.posexplode(tableau).alias(\"p\", \"word\") donne une ligne par élément avec sa position.","posexplode commence à 0 : ajoute 1."],"summary_fr":"Coupe chaque texte en mots (séparés par un espace) et renvoie une ligne par mot avec sa position (1 pour le premier). Trie par line_id puis pos.","tags":["split","posexplode"],"minutes":5,"source":"Kata Lab","files":null,"visible":[{"input":{"lines_df":{"__df__":{"schema":"line_id INT, text STRING","rows":[[1,"big data is fun"],[2,"spark"]]}}},"expected":{"columns":["line_id","pos","word"],"rows":[[1,1,"big"],[1,2,"data"],[1,3,"is"],[1,4,"fun"],[2,1,"spark"]]}},{"input":{"lines_df":{"__df__":{"schema":"line_id INT, text STRING","rows":[[7,"a b a"],[3,"x y"]]}}},"expected":{"columns":["line_id","pos","word"],"rows":[[3,1,"x"],[3,2,"y"],[7,1,"a"],[7,2,"b"],[7,3,"a"]]}}],"hidden_n":3,"hidden":"","solution":""}